   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of Private Participation and Concessions in Infrastructure- Second Stage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide efficient quality infrastructure services to promote the competitiveness of the Colombian economy. Component 1) Support institutional strengthening of policy and regulatory institutions required for the concession and supervision of infrastructure sectors. Component 2) Support the preparation and promotion of specific processes for private participation in these sectors.</narrative>
